flowchart LR
  Browser[Angular browser application] <--> |HTTP API requests| API[ASP.NET Core Web API]
  API <--> DB[(SQL Server users, configuration, forecast and recommendation records)]
  API <--> |30 daily observations and 7 forecast days| Python[Python FastAPI LSTM service]
  Provider[Operational observation source] --> API
  ERA5[(Repository historical ERA5 CSV)] --> Python
