  Seasonal --> API
  API --> Out1[Output 1: 7 day AI weather]
  API --> Out2[Output 2: conditional crops by date range]
  API --> Out3[Output 3: approximate periods by crop]
  API --> Suitability[Separate evidence gated suitability assessment]
  Out1 --> Browser
  Out2 --> Browser
  Out3 --> Browser
  Suitability --> Browser
